{"page":414,"width":1604,"height":2241,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"이번에는 정점 c입니다. 유일한 인접 정점이 F뿐이었는데 이미 방문했으므로 지금은 인접 정점이","words":[{"text":"이번에는","x":169,"y":190,"width":112,"height":34},{"text":"정점","x":293,"y":190,"width":52,"height":34},{"text":"c입니다.","x":357,"y":190,"width":114,"height":34},{"text":"유일한","x":485,"y":190,"width":83,"height":34},{"text":"인접","x":579,"y":190,"width":50,"height":34},{"text":"정점이","x":643,"y":188,"width":75,"height":36},{"text":"F뿐이었는데","x":731,"y":187,"width":150,"height":35},{"text":"이미","x":895,"y":186,"width":52,"height":35},{"text":"방문했으므로","x":961,"y":184,"width":175,"height":35},{"text":"지금은","x":1148,"y":183,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"인접","x":1253,"y":184,"width":56,"height":34},{"text":"정점이","x":1326,"y":185,"width":93,"height":35}]},{"text":"없습니다. C를 리스트의 헤드로 추가하고 뒤로 돌아갑니다.","words":[{"text":"없습니다.","x":171,"y":254,"width":115,"height":34},{"text":"C를","x":297,"y":255,"width":51,"height":32},{"text":"리스트의","x":358,"y":254,"width":108,"height":34},{"text":"헤드로","x":478,"y":255,"width":81,"height":33},{"text":"추가하고","x":567,"y":254,"width":107,"height":34},{"text":"뒤로","x":682,"y":253,"width":53,"height":33},{"text":"돌아갑니다.","x":742,"y":252,"width":141,"height":35}]},{"text":"정점 A의 인접 정점은 c와 D 2개입니다. c는 이미 방문했고 D는 방문하지 않았으므로 D를 타고","words":[{"text":"정점","x":173,"y":770,"width":50,"height":31},{"text":"A의","x":234,"y":771,"width":49,"height":31},{"text":"인접","x":297,"y":771,"width":54,"height":31},{"text":"정점은","x":365,"y":771,"width":83,"height":32},{"text":"c와","x":457,"y":771,"width":50,"height":32},{"text":"D","x":516,"y":776,"width":23,"height":24},{"text":"2개입니다.","x":551,"y":770,"width":127,"height":32},{"text":"c는","x":691,"y":772,"width":49,"height":29},{"text":"이미","x":750,"y":770,"width":50,"height":31},{"text":"방문했고","x":813,"y":769,"width":108,"height":33},{"text":"D는","x":931,"y":769,"width":54,"height":30},{"text":"방문하지","x":995,"y":767,"width":110,"height":32},{"text":"않았으므로","x":1120,"y":766,"width"